COMMENT     TPA: Third-Party Annotation derived from ENA metagenome assembly
            ERZ18661299 (contig ERZ18661299.273; BioProject PRJEB47226;
            BioSample SAMEA6872951; raw reads ERR4194644). A 34 bp direct
            terminal repeat (DTR) was trimmed to yield the 37043 bp circularized
            sequence, verified by raw paired-end read mapping (minimap2 -ax sr,
            29.72x mean depth, 100% coverage, 116 reads spanning the entire DTR
            seam). Circularization joins CTG_000273_48 and CTG_000273_1 in-frame
            into a single complete 162-aa DNA repair protein CDS
            (join(36682..37043,1..127)).
